# JobCoachAI — Database Table Architecture

Based on the MVP Definition doc (Section 13: Suggested Core Data Model). Designed for Postgres via Supabase, with Supabase Auth handling anonymous/upgraded users.

---

## users
Backed by Supabase Auth (`auth.users`). Optional public-schema extension table if you need app-specific fields beyond what Supabase Auth stores:

| Column | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| id | uuid, PK | References `auth.users.id` |
| is_anonymous | boolean | True until upgraded to permanent account |
| upgraded_at | timestamptz, nullable | Set when anonymous → permanent |
| created_at | timestamptz | |

